OL,3,GNEWSAUninsured driver who fatally hit
OL,4,Aboy, 7, jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn uninsured driver who fatally injured
OL,7,Fa seven-year-old boy has been jailed
OL,8,Ffor three-and-a-half years.
OL,10,FJack Rooke died in hospital after he
OL,11,Fstepped out in front of the BMW Nathan
OL,12,FShaw was driving along Longfield
OL,13,FAvenue, in the Golcar area of
OL,14,FHuddersfield, on 30 August 2023.
OL,16,FShaw, 35, who produced forged documents
OL,17,Fin an effort to claim he had been
OL,18,Finsured at the time of the collision,
OL,19,Fwas jailed after pleading guilty to
OL,20,Fcausing death while driving uninsured
OL,21,Fand two counts of perverting the course
OL,22,Fof justice.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
